:"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-29T14:31:39Z","updated_at":"2015-03-29T14:31:39Z","body":"I've tried to dig it deaper. This is a way how it gets 'default' string value set:\n\n**vendor/cakephp/cakephp/src/ORM/Table.php.Cake\\ORM\\Table->connection:395\nvendor/cakephp/cakephp/src/ORM/Table.php.Cake\\ORM\\Table->__construct:252\nvendor/cakephp/cakephp/src/ORM/TableRegistry.php.Cake\\ORM\\TableRegistry::get:195\nvendor/cakephp/acl/src/Model/Table/AclNodesTable.php.Acl\\Model\\Table\\AclNodesTable->node:118**\n\nAclNodesTable->node function sends connection option 'default' to  Cake\\ORM\\TableRegistry::get:195 and there is a block which ignores it's conversion to the object:\n\n``` javascript\nif (empty($options['connection'])) {\n            $connectionName = $options['className']::defaultConnectionName();\n            $options['connection'] = ConnectionManager::get($connectionName);\n}\n```\n\nHope it helps.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/87421324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"janlebowski","id":11705039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzA1MDM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11705039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski","html_url":"https://github.com/janlebowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlebowski/starred{/own